# Subsystem Ports

- Protocols live in `pytierra/models/ports.py`.
- `services/genebank`, `services/observer`, and `services/net` must **not** import `services.vm`.
- Those packages must **not** import each other. Wire only through `TierraVM` / bootstrap and Protocol data.
- ISA may call `genebank.dirty` helpers and `VMContext.notify_*` only — not RamBanker / DiskBank / Observer / NET logic.
- Disk I/O stays in `adapters/`; deferred flush via write queue on VM boundary (`step` / `run` / `stop`).
